OL,3,GNEWSACouncil finances in 'severe'
OL,4,Atrouble, warns report
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent report into the finances
OL,7,Fat Worcestershire County Council has
OL,8,Fwarned that it is facing "severe and
OL,9,Fescalating" pressure - and is not
OL,10,Fsustainable without another emergency
OL,11,Fgovernment bailout.
OL,13,FIt also cited concern over reserves
OL,14,Fbeing "critically low", and said the
OL,15,Fcouncil had "repeatedly been unable" to
OL,16,Fdeliver enough savings, warning of a
OL,17,F"widening" black hole.
OL,19,FThe assessment was triggered after the
OL,20,Fcouncil secured #60m in emergency
OL,21,Fgovernment support for this financial
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
