OL,3,GNEWSACouncil finances in 'severe'
OL,4,Atrouble, warns report
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen councillor Matt Jenkins, the
OL,7,Fauthority's leader, said: "We are not
OL,8,Fgoing to argue with the findings of the
OL,9,Freport - we are getting on with fixing
OL,10,Fthe issues it identified."
